  "notes": "Modified cash basis city (governmental modified cash, business-type accrual). Governmental lines from the Total Governmental Funds column (p5); roll-forward on fund balances 534,670 + 487,863 - 620,945 = 401,588. Ending cash = Balance Sheet (p4) Total Governmental Funds 'Cash and cash equivalents' 270,531 (county treasurer cash 1,902 printed separately); certificates of deposit 129,155 in ending_investments; beginning cash not printed. Business-type lines from the proprietary statement Total column (p7), measure net position: 2,098,870 + 248,737 - 450,407 = 1,897,200. Business 'Other revenue' 2,003 is Miscellaneous (general revenue) on the SoA p3, so other. Balance sheet: government-wide Statement of Net Position (p1), because the governmental column includes capital assets and debt (793,501 vs funds 401,588). Detail: the General Fund departmental combining statement is only partly in the trim (p12 = right half: Park, Garbage Disposal, Landfill, Total columns with no row labels; the left half with labels and the General/other department columns is missing), so it is not recorded; the General Fund budget schedule (p9) is used instead. Street (p10) and Sales Tax (p11) budget schedules recorded; zero-actual budget rows kept with amount 0. No utility budget schedules. No transfers. Read pages 1-12 of 12"
